OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood pals create 'love
OL,4,Aletter' to Doctor Who
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Doctor Who fans who started making
OL,7,Ffilms 20 years ago in their back
OL,8,Fgardens have now produced a #11k indie
OL,9,Ffeature with a premiere attended by
OL,10,Fformer cast members of the show.
OL,12,FMark Bray, 28, from Bristol, produced
OL,13,FDoctor Who: Outlander with fellow fans
OL,14,Fof the long-running BBC sci-fi series;
OL,15,Fit took two years to come to fruition.
OL,17,FBray spent his childhood honing his
OL,18,Ffilm-making skills with his friend, Tom
OL,19,FSkinner, 33, from Bath, who acted as
OL,20,Fscript supervisor on the project.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
